{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00435","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后明堂乐章 皇嗣出入升降 · 武则天","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后明堂乐章 皇嗣出入升降","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至人光俗，大孝通神。\n谦以表性，恭惟立身。\n洪规载啓，茂典方陈。\n誉隆三善，祥开万春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武则天","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}